`BORROWER.wallet_address` has a UNIQUE constraint. In a single-chain prototype this is correct. However, the thesis specifies CCIP cross-chain operations and SBT mirroring. The same user will have the same wallet address on multiple EVM chains — but their `CREDIT_PASSPORT` state, `COLLATERAL_POSITION`, and `BORROWING_LIMIT` may differ per chain.

